{"slug":"dirk-nowitzkis-pro-celebrity-tennis-classic-celebrates-its-third-year","postId":72887,"title":"Dirk Nowitzki’s Pro Celebrity Tennis Classic Celebrates its Third Year","htmlContent":"<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_500283\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"3264\"]<img class=\"size-full wp-image-500283\" src=\"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/unnamed-64.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3264\" height=\"2448\" /> Photo Credit -Tre’Oshula Mone’t[/caption]\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3jR4ooAtU9g\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Dallas Maverick’s Dirk </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Nowitzki</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> held his third annual Tennis Classic at </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">the Southern Methodist University Tennis Complex. Admission cost for this event was $20, and free for children 3 and under.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">To start off the event, a press conference was held at approximately 9:45 am on the sidelines of the Tennis Court. Along with Dirk, there was a strong line of professional Tennis players there such as Andy Roddick, 2003 U.S. Open champion; Tommy Haas, German ATP Tour player; Mark Knowles, three-time Olympic medalist and former world No. 1 in doubles</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Dirk also brought along some of his fellow NBA representatives with him</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">; </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Dwight Powell, Devin Harris, and former Maverick Monta Ellis</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">. </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">“So Monta, I’ve never seen play, but he claims he was an all-American in high school or something,” Nowitzki jokingly said at the press conference. “And Dwight, already told me last year that he could play,”.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> [ 0:03 (video recording)]</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Monta </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Ellis</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> was asked to give a little of his tennis history.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">“Well, I played tennis in middle school through high school, until I graduated my senior year. So, I’m pretty familiar with the game,” said Ellis.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">Dirk’s teammate, Dwight Powell, gave a few words expressing his gratitude towards Dirk giving back to the community</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">“It's very motivating, I think for all of us</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">, I </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">think </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">in</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> the Dallas Community, athletes or not, to get involved </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">and</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> help. He’s left such a tremendous footprint in a positive way in the city and in this state,” said Powell.</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> “</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">So,</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> any time that he calls any of us, you can ask any of our teammates that have played</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">, if he </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">calls </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">them to come out, they’ll be there because they know how big of a deal it is here in Dallas and in Texas to be involved in one of his events.”</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> [</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> 0:38 (recording</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">)]</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-OutlineElement m_8122774331755350400gmail-Ltr m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">\n<p class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-Paragraph m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> All proceeds from this Tennis Match were donated to the Dirk Nowitzki Foundation. The foundation </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">offer</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">s </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">educat</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">ion, health, and </span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\">well-being</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> for children. [</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-TextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-NormalTextRun m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"><a href=\"http://dnfoundation.org/about-the-foundation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=http://dnfoundation.org/about-the-foundation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1537239354738000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGsW0SGkBd5VK2v3gXlbQb8U9jb3g\">http://dnfoundation.org/<wbr />about-the-foundation</a>]</span></span><span class=\"m_8122774331755350400gmail-EOP m_8122774331755350400gmail-SCXW34758444\"> </span></p>\nIn the final round of the Dirk Nowitzki Pro-Celebrity Tennis Classic, former tennis pro-Mark Knowles and amateur Camelia Georgiana Marta defeated tennis pro Mitchell Krueger and amateur Jessica Nowitzki 10-5.\n\n</div>","excerpt":"[caption id=\"attachment_500283\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"3264\"] Photo Credit -Tre’Oshula Mone’t[/caption] Dallas Maverick’s Dirk Nowitzki held his third annual Tennis Classic at the Southern…","publishedAt":"2018-09-17T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2026-04-15T19:37:32Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"andy-roddick","name":"Andy Roddick"},{"slug":"devin-harris","name":"Devin Harris"},{"slug":"dirk-nowitzki","name":"Dirk Nowitzki"},{"slug":"dwight-powell","name":"Dwight Powell"},{"slug":"jessica-nowitzki","name":"Jessica Nowitzki"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"mark-knowles","name":"Mark Knowles"},{"slug":"mitchell-krueger","name":"Mitchell Krueger"},{"slug":"monta-ellis","name":"Monta Ellis"},{"slug":"tommy-haas","name":"Tommy Haas"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/unnamed-64.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://35.224.26.164/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/unnamed-64.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":2,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/dirk-nowitzkis-pro-celebrity-tennis-classic-celebrates-its-third-year/"}